add r2 r2 1
j while6
endwhile6:
l r2 d0 SignalStrength
s d2 Setting r2
l r2 d0 Horizontal
s d3 Setting r2
l r2 d0 Vertical
s d4 Setting r2
j ra
fineTune:
push ra
l r5 d0 SignalStrength
move r6 r0
move r7 r1
add r0 r0 r2
add r1 r1 r4
max r1 0 r1
min r1 90 r1
jal aim
l r2 d0 SignalStrength
beq r2 -1 or1
beq r5 -1 else4
bgt r2 r5 skip4
j else4
